{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72801","main_id":72801,"main_title":"诸国游记","main_description":"稻妻城里的小绿似乎正为什么事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"诸国游记","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7280103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7280103,"sequence":8,"variant":0,"line_id":728010311,"next_line_ids":[728010312],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3012,"speaker_text_hash":3312405141,"speaker":"拉姆齐","speaker_raw":"拉姆齐","text_hash":3625146226,"text":"没错，严肃地来说，这些「游记」都不是真的。","raw_text":"没错，严肃地来说，这些「游记」都不是真的。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7280103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72801","main_id":72801,"main_title":"诸国游记","main_description":"稻妻城里的小绿似乎正为什么事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"诸国游记","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7280103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7280103,"sequence":9,"variant":0,"line_id":728010312,"next_line_ids":[728010313],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3012,"speaker_text_hash":3312405141,"speaker":"拉姆齐","speaker_raw":"拉姆齐","text_hash":1566190482,"text":"虽然有些地点和人物确实是取材于现实…但大部分的内容，都是出自于我个人的想象。","raw_text":"虽然有些地点和人物确实是取材于现实…但大部分的内容，都是出自于我个人的想象。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7280103.json"}
