{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72801","main_id":72801,"main_title":"诸国游记","main_description":"稻妻城里的小绿似乎正为什么事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"诸国游记","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7280103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7280103,"sequence":12,"variant":0,"line_id":728010315,"next_line_ids":[728010316],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3012,"speaker_text_hash":3312405141,"speaker":"拉姆齐","speaker_raw":"拉姆齐","text_hash":2948729362,"text":"而且，操作这个气球完全不需要「神之眼」，只需要有技术常识就行。","raw_text":"而且，操作这个气球完全不需要「神之眼」，只需要有技术常识就行。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7280103.json"}
