{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72801","main_id":72801,"main_title":"诸国游记","main_description":"稻妻城里的小绿似乎正为什么事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"诸国游记","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7280103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7280103,"sequence":16,"variant":0,"line_id":728010319,"next_line_ids":[728010320],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3012,"speaker_text_hash":3312405141,"speaker":"拉姆齐","speaker_raw":"拉姆齐","text_hash":3486661322,"text":"你看见走廊上那个家伙了吗？他叫平八，不知道从什么时候起，那家伙就一直盯着我。","raw_text":"你看见走廊上那个家伙了吗？他叫平八，不知道从什么时候起，那家伙就一直盯着我。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7280103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72801","main_id":72801,"main_title":"诸国游记","main_description":"稻妻城里的小绿似乎正为什么事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"诸国游记","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7280103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7280103,"sequence":17,"variant":0,"line_id":728010320,"next_line_ids":[728010321],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3012,"speaker_text_hash":3312405141,"speaker":"拉姆齐","speaker_raw":"拉姆齐","text_hash":3186722346,"text":"我本来想出去采风，给那篇「游记」取取材，但那家伙每次都跟着我，不知道想做什么。","raw_text":"我本来想出去采风，给那篇「游记」取取材，但那家伙每次都跟着我，不知道想做什么。","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7280103.json"}
{"chapter_id":"main-quest-72801","main_id":72801,"main_title":"诸国游记","main_description":"稻妻城里的小绿似乎正为什么事而烦恼…","chapter_title":"诸国游记","chapter_number":"","subquest_index":1,"subquest_id":7280103,"subquest_title":"","talk_id":7280103,"sequence":18,"variant":0,"line_id":728010321,"next_line_ids":[728010322],"speaker_type":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speaker_id":3012,"speaker_text_hash":3312405141,"speaker":"拉姆齐","speaker_raw":"拉姆齐","text_hash":3223769818,"text":"因为担心这家伙对我图谋不轨，我也就不敢出去采风了，这篇「游记」也就搁置了下来…","raw_text":"因为担心这家伙对我图谋不轨，我也就不敢出去采风了，这篇「游记」也就搁置了下来…","resolved":true,"source_file":"BinOutput/Talk/Quest/7280103.json"}
